    <tags>cafe awake caffeine keep-awake sleep power tray utility</tags>
    <summary>Keep your PC awake from the tray</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
A coffee cup in the notification area that keeps Windows from going to sleep,
like PowerToys Awake without the rest of PowerToys.

* Keep your PC awake for as long as you like, for a set time, until a time of
  day, or while an app is open.
* Keep the screen on too, if you want.
* Left-click the cup to switch it on or off.
* It never changes your power plan. It just asks Windows not to sleep, and
  that request goes away when Cafe stops, even if it crashes.

One small executable, nothing else to install.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/kidchenko/cafe/releases</releaseNotes>
